l":"https://github.com/SizzlingWalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T08:32:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T08:32:37Z","body":"Great, I will do my best :)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600833869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603238243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113402#issuecomment-3603238243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113402","id":3603238243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WxQ1j","user":{"login":"SizzlingWalrus","id":81528628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI4NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81528628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/SizzlingWalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T17:40:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T17:40:12Z","body":"Just to let you know that I’m actively working on this:\r\n\r\nI found that `TabContainer::_on_tab_visibility_changed()` only triggers when the tab is currently selected.\r\nIf a tab is hidden while not selected, the `visibility_changed ` signal is not emitted and the selection logic does not run.\r\nThis explains why hiding the selected tab works correctly, but hiding all tabs (or hiding a non-selected tab) leaves current in an invalid state.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603238243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806157265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113402#issuecomment-3806157265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113402","id":3806157265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i3VnR","user":{"login":"SizzlingWalrus","id":81528628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI4NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81528628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/SizzlingWalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SizzlingWalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T16:24:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T16:24:34Z","body":"I've updated the logic to include your p_hidden suggestion.\r\n\r\n`if (p_hidden && _are_all_tabs_hidden()) {\r\n    current = -1;\r\n}`\r\n\r\nI decided to keep the fix within `TabBar::set_tab_hidden(int p_tab, bool p_hidden)` because `TabContainer::_on_tab_visibility_changed(Control *p_child` only triggers when switching between tabs.\r\nBy placing it here, we ensure the state is handled correctly as soon as a tab is hidden.\r\n\r\nSince I'm still new to the codebase, I'd love to hear your thoughts on this approach.\r\nDoes this placement make sense to you, or would you prefer it handled elsewhere?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806157265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3811955402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113402#issuecomment-3811955402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113402","id":3811955402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jNdLK","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gr